## Stage 2: Data Aggregation & Combining Datasets
This layer covers summarizing data and combining multiple tables into a single result set.
* **Aggregate Functions:** COUNT(), SUM(), AVG(), MIN(), MAX()
* **Grouping Data:** GROUP BY, HAVING (filtering aggregated results)
* **Table Joins:**
   * INNER JOIN, LEFT (OUTER) JOIN, RIGHT (OUTER) JOIN, FULL (OUTER) JOIN
   * CROSS JOIN (Cartesian product), SELF JOIN
* **Set Operations:** UNION, UNION ALL, INTERSECT, EXCEPT / MINUS
